WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.317
Create a run from the test repository.

2
00:00:05.317 --> 00:00:10.783
Name the release iteration.

3
00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:21.300
Describe the scope of this regression.

4
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:26.900
Set the build that will be tested.

5
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:35.817
Assign an owner and select the checks.

6
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:41.233
Create the run with all 30 test cases.

7
00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:46.033
Start the run when the team is ready.

8
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:51.350
Record the result of the first step.

9
00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:55.967
Continue through the expected results.

10
00:00:55.967 --> 00:01:00.867
Pass the case and move to the next check.
